      "citation_path": "us/rulemaking/federal-register/2026-08-04/2026-15799",
      "metadata": {
        "abstract": "This notice revises the tariff rate on patented pharmaceuticals and associated pharmaceutical ingredients that are products of the United Kingdom from 10 percent to zero percent in accordance with Proclamation 11020 \"Adjusting Imports of Pharmaceuticals and Pharmaceutical Ingredients Into the United States.\"",
